WEBVTT

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:30.621
when we got to the island.

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:34.996
Of course, as most people know now,
nothing was as promised.

00:01:35.413 --> 00:01:39.163
We were not a luxury resort style.

00:01:39.163 --> 00:01:41.871
We were just in pretty damp tents,

00:01:41.871 --> 00:01:45.246
basically spending the whole time there
trying to figure out how to get out.

00:01:47.246 --> 00:01:49.163
There's a name for what
happened with Alexis.

00:01:49.621 --> 00:01:53.329
It's called Escalation of commitment
to a losing course of action.

00:01:53.871 --> 00:01:55.746
It's when you find out you've
made a bad decision,

00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:58.704
but instead of cutting your losses,
you doubled down.

00:01:59.288 --> 00:02:02.204
You invest your time, your
money or your identity